      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:5:2:5",
      "text": [
        " إِذَا دُعِيتَ إِلَى الشَّهَادَةِ فَأَجِبْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Isa, from Al nazar Bin Suweyd, from Al Qasim Bin Suleyman, from Jarrah Al Madainy, ",
          "He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘When you are summoned to the testimony, so answer’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. A number of our people have narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from al-Nadr ibn Suwayd from al-Qasim ibn Sulayman from Jarrah al-Madi’iniy who has narrated the following: “He (the Imam), ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘When you are called to present your testimony you must accept to testify.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
